# ==============================================================================
# DenseConstantRegressor — .gitignore
# ==============================================================================
# 本仓库只收录「代码 + 文档 + 图 + 日志」。
# 原始 dump 与全部中间产物（约 14 GB）一律不入库，见 README「数据获取」一节。
# This repository tracks code, docs, figures and run logs ONLY.
# Raw dumps and every intermediate artifact (~14 GB) are excluded on purpose.
# ==============================================================================

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 数据 / Data —— 约 14 GB，绝不入库 (never commit)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 骨架用 .gitkeep 保留：raw/{extracted,extracted_10k}/, processed/, legacy/
data/**
!data/**/
!data/**/.gitkeep

# 数据格式兜底（万一放到 data/ 之外也不误传）
# Format-level safety net in case artifacts are ever written outside data/
*.parquet
*.npz
*.npy
*.feather
*.h5
*.hdf5
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.db
*.dump
*.sql
*.tar.bz2
*.tar.gz
*.zip
*.7z

# 例外 / exception —— CM3P 混用探针的参考向量：
#   256 张已发布谱面的 512 维 CM3P 向量（float32，约 0.5 MB），是 scripts/step0e_validate_mix.py
#   的**测试夹具**，不是数据产物。没有它，远程机器就必须先下 615 MB 的 244K 表才能回答
#   "no-audio 的行能不能和已发布的行混用"。见 docs/cm3p_remote_runbook.md。
!manifests/cm3p_probe_1k.npz

# 大体积 / 模型权重 (large blobs & model weights)
*.safetensors
*.ckpt
*.pt
*.pth
*.onnx
*.bin

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 第三方仓库 / Third-party checkouts
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# external/bobert 是 token03/bobert 的独立克隆（自带 .git），只作参考资料。
# 不 vendor 他人代码：按 README「参考资料」一节自行 clone。
# external/bobert is a standalone clone of token03/bobert (it has its own .git).
# Deliberately not vendored — clone it yourself, see README "References".
external/

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Python
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
.Python
build/
develop-eggs/
dist/
downloads/
eggs/
.eggs/
lib64/
parts/
sdist/
var/
wheels/
share/python-wheels/
*.egg-info/
.installed.cfg
*.egg
MANIFEST

# 虚拟环境 / Virtual environments
.venv/
venv/
ENV/
env/
.python-version

# 测试与类型检查缓存 / Test & type-check caches
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.tox/
.nox/
.coverage
.coverage.*
htmlcov/
.hypothesis/

# Jupyter
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 编辑器与 IDE / Editors & IDEs
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.*.swp
.spyderproject
.spyproject
.ropeproject
tags
TAGS

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 操作系统 / OS
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
ehthumbs.db
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 工具链 / Agent tooling
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# .workbuddy-ai/ 是 AI 助手的过程记忆（面向工具上下文，非项目交付物）；
# 技术结论已整理进 docs/。
# .workbuddy-ai/ holds agent working memory (tool-facing, not a deliverable);
# its technical conclusions are curated into docs/.
.workbuddy-ai/

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 环境变量与密钥 / Env vars & secrets
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
credentials.json

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 本地上传凭据提示 / Local upload-credential note (never commit)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
.github_push_code.txt

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 临时文件 / Scratch files
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.tmp
*.temp
*.bak
*.orig
*.rej
*.part
.cache/

# 本地上传助手（不入库）/ Local upload helper
upload_to_github.sh
